tchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">g</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">h</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> and compare real and imaginary\nparts.</em></p>","file":"ch12-spectral-theory/09-circulants-and-the-dft.html"}